4. Data Storage
The program uses a plain-text file named study_log.txt. Each study session is stored as one record. When the program starts, load_sessions() attempts to read the file. If the file does not exist, the program starts with an empty list instead of crashing. Selecting Save and exit rewrites the file with all current sessions.
